'''Nobiluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekolugas]] and [[WAVE BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|WAVE BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.3 Update|Version 9.3]] reduces cost and recharge time. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]].

